      "note": "argv, never a shell (Open3 with an array). Two interpolated arguments: user@host, which cannot become an ssh option (Machine validates ssh_host and ssh_user to a hostname/IP and a login name with no leading dash, and the argv puts -- before it); and UserKnownHostsFile=<path>, a Tempfile path the console made (HostKey.with_known_hosts). The command after the destination is sent to the box's forced command, which validates it there."
